{"id":726,"name":"torracat","speciesId":726,"dex":726,"form":"normal","generation":7,"types":["fire"],"stats":{"hp":65,"attack":85,"defense":50,"special-attack":80,"special-defense":50,"speed":90},"abilities":[{"name":"blaze","hidden":false},{"name":"intimidate","hidden":true}],"height":7,"weight":250,"baseExp":147,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/726.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/726.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/726.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/726.ogg","genus":"Fire Cat Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon Gato de Fogo","flavor":[{"version":"sun","text":"At its throat, it bears a bell of fire. The bell rings brightly whenever this Pokémon spits fire."},{"version":"moon","text":"It boasts powerful front legs. With a single punch, it can bend an iron bar right over."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"It can act spoiled if it grows close to its Trainer. A powerful Pokémon, its sharp claws can leave its Trainer’s whole body covered in scratches."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"When its mane is standing on end, you can tell it’s feeling good. When it isn’t feeling well, its fur will lie down flat."},{"version":"sword","text":"In the midst of battle, the fire pouch on Torracat’s neck rings like a bell and produces stronger flames than usual."},{"version":"shield","text":"When facing a powerful enemy, Torracat’s fighting spirit gets pumped up, and its fire bell blazes hotter."}],"flavorPt":"Ao enfrentar um inimigo poderoso, o espírito de luta de Torracat aumenta e seu sino de fogo fica mais forte.","genderRate":1,"captureRate":45,"eggGroups":["ground"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"litten","speciesId":725,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 17"],"species":"torracat","s